<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups NGC long term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups NGC long term.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst John Olson said on Tuesday he had boosted NGC Corp to long-term buy from accumulate and kept the natural gas liquids company at near-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We're becoming more aggressive on it again because the profitability of the business is better than ever,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- The merger with Chevron Corp's natural gas unit, completed last month, &quot;is working out splendidly,&quot; Olson said. &quot;They're off to the races.&quot;</p>
<p>-- NGC stock closed on Tuesday at 17-1/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
